        "id": 54,
        "question": "Define Business Structure\n",
        "answer": "Choose the appropriate entity type (e.g., Global Business Company or Domestic Company) based on your business activities and expansion goals\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 55,
        "question": "Company Registration\n",
